      "side": 1,
      "message": "If one passes in a family name and that gets a (real) hit, then even just the `CTFontCreateForString` will match style.\n\nHowever, passing in `nullptr` or otherwise ending up with a \"default font\" will do fallback but not apply the style (possibly because the somewhat magic \"default font\" doesn\u0027t really have any styles other than default). Making a copy with style attributes still doesn\u0027t dislodge this \"default font with no styles\" bit and the style doesn\u0027t change.",
      "revId": "dfa008371606c907eefb5b0492844a2c74dc560b",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
